248
00:21:52.018 --> 00:21:54.782
Pulse is shallow, but steady.
Keep her comfortable.

249
00:21:54.955 --> 00:21:57.446
We should take turns on the radio,
if that's all right.

250
00:21:58.058 --> 00:22:00.788
No, it's not. I can manage.

251
00:22:16.877 --> 00:22:19.971
You gonna arrest me, officer?

252
00:22:23.516 --> 00:22:25.484
What?

253
00:22:26.486 --> 00:22:29.922
How'd you do that?
How'd you know I was a cop?

254
00:22:33.426 --> 00:22:35.792
No shit.

255
00:22:38.431 --> 00:22:41.025
Cheetos for dinner, huh?

256
00:22:41.201 --> 00:22:44.762
-That don't seem right.
-You got a better idea?

257
00:22:44.938 --> 00:22:49.170
I worked mess in the service.
Maybe the diner's open. I could--

258
00:22:49.342 --> 00:22:52.334
You got change for a dollar?

259
00:22:52.879 --> 00:22:55.871
I don't know. Let me see.

260
00:23:05.125 --> 00:23:07.616
Here you go.

261
00:23:09.229 --> 00:23:10.992
You got a name?

262
00:23:12.332 --> 00:23:15.130
-Paris.
-Paris, huh?

263
00:23:15.302 --> 00:23:16.599
I'll get it.

264
00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.965
Never been.

265
