Well, you ain't going tonight.

266
00:23:32.786 --> 00:23:34.686
Please.

267
00:23:34.854 --> 00:23:37.584
Please be strong.

268
00:23:38.224 --> 00:23:42.024
You see, Timothy and l...

269
00:23:42.195 --> 00:23:44.561
...we need you.

270
00:23:45.165 --> 00:23:47.827
We need you so much.

271
00:24:46.726 --> 00:24:48.489
Lou?

272
00:24:51.031 --> 00:24:53.056
Lou?

273
00:25:24.431 --> 00:25:27.195
You need to tell them, Harry,
that I can't work, I can't perform...

274
00:25:27.367 --> 00:25:30.234
...l can't shine living
in an environment like that.

275
00:25:30.403 --> 00:25:34.840
No, it is not about the money.
It's about the working conditions.

276
00:26:06.506 --> 00:26:08.406
One bar.

277
00:26:09.008 --> 00:26:10.942
One bar.

278
00:26:11.144 --> 00:26:12.304
No bar.

279
00:26:13.279 --> 00:26:14.837
One bar.

280
00:26:15.014 --> 00:26:16.174
Two bars.

281
00:26:18.084 --> 00:26:20.450
Come on. Come on.

282
00:26:21.087 --> 00:26:22.850
Here we go.

283
00:26:25.225 --> 00:26:28.058
There you go. Come on.

284
00:26:31.931 --> 00:26:34.491
Goddamn desert wasteland!

285
00:26:42.408 --> 00:26:46.401
Oh, shit! I just had it.

286
00:30:28.167 --> 00:30:30.931
Holy fuck.

287
00:31:00.600 --> 00:31:04.331
-Jesus, Mother of God.
-Who is this?

288
00:31:04.504 --> 00:31:07.769
The woman I was driving.

289
00:31:10.676 --> 00:31:13.873
-What the hell are you doing?
-There's something in there.

290
00:31:14.046 --> 00:31:16.139
-Use this, man.
-Thanks.

291
00:31:16.315 --> 00:31:19.512
-Are you a cop?
-I was.

292
00:31:27.260 --> 00:31:30.559
-She was in Room 1 0?
-I am.

293
00:31:32.265 --> 00:31:36.292
-Where's your guy?
-Cuffed to a toilet.

294
00:31:46.345 --> 00:31:48.506
Son of a bitch.

295
00:31:49.816 --> 00:31:52.216
That was a fucking drive.

296
00:31:56.422 --> 00:31:59.391
-Gentlemen.
-Your Honor.

297
00:32:05.765 --> 00:32:09.462
Ready, Sharon? Alrighty.

298
00:32:09.635 --> 00:32:13.071
In the matter of Rivers v. Nevada,
for the purposes of--

299
00:32:13.239 --> 00:32:18.836
Judge Taylor, sir, with due respect,
we should wait till my client arrives.

300
00:32:19.312 --> 00:32:23.271
-He has a right to be present.
-He has precious few rights.

301
00:32:23.449 --> 00:32:25.349
He's 24 hours from execution.

302
00:32:26.452 --> 00:32:29.444
But to demonstrate his
mental state, which is the purpose--

303
00:32:29.822 --> 00:32:31.687
His mental state?

304
00:32:32.258 --> 00:32:34.021
His mental state?

305
00:32:34.560 --> 00:32:38.553
Do you know what time it is?
You think I got time for bullshit?

306
00:32:38.731 --> 00:32:42.326
That the justices called me in the
middle of the night to review a case...

307
00:32:42.502 --> 00:32:46.939
...l already sat on, that I already
decided, may make you happy.

308
00:32:47.106 --> 00:32:49.165
But it pisses me off.

309
00:32:49.408 --> 00:32:53.310
When your boy gets here, do what you
want, but in the name of decency...

310
00:32:53.479 --> 00:32:56.039
...state your goddamn case!

311
00:32:57.884 --> 00:33:00.011
Yes, sir.

312
00:33:00.186 --> 00:33:02.211
Somebody get me
a cup of coffee, black.

313
00:33:07.894 --> 00:33:12.024
All right, everybody! Listen up!

314
00:33:12.999 --> 00:33:14.626
There was an incident tonight.

315
00:33:14.800 --> 00:33:16.893
That's police talk for,
"Someone's head got lopped off."

316
00:33:17.069 --> 00:33:18.468
Larry!

317
00:33:19.839 --> 00:33:22.865
-Caroline Suzanne was murdered.
-What?

318
00:33:23.042 --> 00:33:26.773
-Who's Caroline Suzanne?
-The actress I was driving.

319
00:33:26.946 --> 00:33:30.177
And where exactly did that happen?

320
00:33:30.349 --> 00:33:33.580
We don't know, because
we can't find the body.

321
00:33:33.786 --> 00:33:35.219
Not all of it anyway.

322
00:33:35.388 --> 00:33:40.451
-What do you mean, you can't find it?
-Stay calm. Everything will be all right.

323
00:33:40.626 --> 00:33:44.562
Officer Rhodes is outside.
He was transporting a convict.

324
00:33:44.730 --> 00:33:47.290
-Who escaped.
-What are you--?

325
00:33:48.434 --> 00:33:50.299
-Hold on.
-Running free!

326
00:33:50.469 --> 00:33:52.903
Will you shut the fuck
up so he can talk?

327
00:33:53.072 --> 00:33:56.041
This is my place, ho!
I'll say what I please!

328
00:33:56.208 --> 00:33:57.835
-It's safe here.
-It is not safe here!

329
00:33:58.010 --> 00:33:59.910
-There's a cop here.
-Yeah, two cops.

330
00:34:00.079 --> 00:34:01.740
Wait. You're a cop?

331
00:34:01.981 --> 00:34:07.476
-I was. Shut up, Larry!
-It's not safe here! I'm not staying--

332
00:34:07.954 --> 00:34:10.582
It's all right. It's okay.

333
00:34:12.158 --> 00:34:14.285
Nothing.

334
00:34:14.460 --> 00:34:17.691
