-Ginny.

335
00:34:17.964 --> 00:34:22.128
Ginny, will you...?
Stop it. Don't do this right now.

336
00:34:23.035 --> 00:34:25.868
-What are you doing?
-Put your arm around your girlfriend.

337
00:34:26.038 --> 00:34:30.099
