-Everybody just stay here.

338
00:34:30.276 --> 00:34:33.336
-Stay in this room.
-Wait! I'm not staying here if he is.

339
00:34:33.613 --> 00:34:35.137
-Yes, you are.
-No, I'm not.

340
00:34:35.314 --> 00:34:38.841
-I'm not.
-All right. Larry?

341
00:34:39.018 --> 00:34:40.451
-Come with us.
-Why?

342
00:34:40.720 --> 00:34:43.621
-You know the place.
-Here's what I know. I'm not a cop.

343
00:34:43.789 --> 00:34:46.383
I don't take orders from
a professional slut!

344
00:34:46.726 --> 00:34:49.718
-Fuck you!
-Listen. Just stay here, please.

345
00:34:49.895 --> 00:34:51.556
Keep everybody calm.

346
00:35:00.106 --> 00:35:03.234
He's not gonna get too far.
Not in this!

347
00:35:05.011 --> 00:35:07.002
Rhodes!

348
00:35:07.313 --> 00:35:08.871
What are we chasing here?

349
00:35:11.751 --> 00:35:14.549
Multiple homicide.

350
00:35:14.954 --> 00:35:18.390
I'll go around this way.
Meet you in back.

351
00:35:31.637 --> 00:35:34.663
Is that where you live
full-time? Las Vegas?

352
00:35:35.775 --> 00:35:39.074
-Used to.
-What's that supposed to mean?

353
00:35:40.880 --> 00:35:44.043
It means I don't live there anymore.

354
00:36:20.720 --> 00:36:21.982
Maine!

355
00:36:23.522 --> 00:36:27.219
We'll go see if we can use this one.
We'll go in here.

356
00:36:27.393 --> 00:36:30.920
Since that wasn't a successful
attempt, we'll go in here.

357
00:36:31.197 --> 00:36:35.759
I'll be right out here. It's okay.
I'm gonna stand guard.

358
00:36:36.001 --> 00:36:40.836
Not a worry. I'll be right here.
I'm not going anywhere.

359
00:36:47.713 --> 00:36:51.945
See, his mother usually does this.

360
00:37:12.905 --> 00:37:17.774
Hey, Ginny. So how long
you two been married?

361
00:37:17.943 --> 00:37:21.845
About nine hours. It was
a spur-of-the-moment kind of thing.

362
00:37:22.481 --> 00:37:24.176
Viva Las Vegas, huh, Gin?

363
00:37:25.184 --> 00:37:27.812
-We need to leave!
-I was just talking to her.

364
00:37:27.987 --> 00:37:30.615
Something's happening!
I need to get out of here!

365
00:37:30.790 --> 00:37:36.023
-Ginny! Ginny!
-You don't own me, Lou!

366
00:37:36.195 --> 00:37:38.493
I own what's inside you!
Half, at least.

367
00:37:38.664 --> 00:37:41.599
You don't own any part
of me or my baby!

368
00:37:41.767 --> 00:37:43.564
Then why did I marry you?

369
00:37:44.170 --> 00:37:48.732
-Don't slam the goddamn door on me!
-Hey! Hey!

370
00:37:48.908 --> 00:37:51.399
You guys, just calm down!

371
00:37:57.683 --> 00:38:02.052
We are not leaving.
There is no place else to go.

372
00:38:02.221 --> 00:38:06.248
There's a flood outside,
Ginny. Stop it! Stop it!

373
00:38:06.425 --> 00:38:09.292
I'm not pregnant!

374
00:38:13.432 --> 00:38:15.798
What did you just say?

375
00:38:18.604 --> 00:38:20.936
I lied.

376
00:38:21.640 --> 00:38:24.336
I'm not pregnant.

377
00:38:27.479 --> 00:38:30.642
What are you talking about?
I saw the test.

378
00:38:35.287 --> 00:38:37.346
Why would you do that to me?

379
00:38:38.190 --> 00:38:42.559
Because Alison saw you at
The Hawk with that fucking girl!

380
00:38:47.233 --> 00:38:50.896
-Ginny, what are we, like 1 5?
-Go away!

381
00:38:52.304 --> 00:38:54.636
Goddamn!

382
00:39:13.726 --> 00:39:16.991
-Open this goddamn door, Ginny!
-No!

383
00:39:17.162 --> 00:39:19.995
I haven't been to The Hawk
in over a fucking year.

384
00:39:20.165 --> 00:39:25.933
Alison is a stupid bitch-whore,
who likes fucking with your head.

385
00:39:26.105 --> 00:39:28.403
Open the damn door, Ginny.

386
00:39:28.641 --> 00:39:32.441
-Open the fucking door!
-Not until you calm down!

387
00:39:32.811 --> 00:39:36.679
I'm calm! I am very fucking calm!

388
00:39:46.358 --> 00:39:48.826
What are you doing?

389
00:39:51.897 --> 00:39:54.661
Lou?

390
00:40:08.948 --> 00:40:13.180
Ginny, open this damn door!
Open the door!

391
00:40:13.686 --> 00:40:16.484
-Open the door!
-Stop it, stop it!

392
00:40:17.623 --> 00:40:22.117
Ginny, damn it, open the door!
Ginny, Ginny, Ginny!

393
00:40:22.294 --> 00:40:24.728
Lou, please stop!

394
00:41:02.634 --> 00:41:05.034
Lou?

395
00:41:46.211 --> 00:41:50.614
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

396
00:41:50.783 --> 00:41:53.581
Help me! Somebody help me!

397
00:42:01.627 --> 00:42:03.993
Help me!

398
00:42:04.363 --> 00:42:07.821
Help me! Somebody help me!

399
00:42:08.233 --> 00:42:11.896
Is he in there? ls he in there?

400
00:42:13.505 --> 00:42:17.066
Ginny, are you okay?
What happened? What happened?

401
00:42:23.782 --> 00:42:26.808
-Oh, shit.
-Jesus Christ.

402
00:42:35.194 --> 00:42:38.254
Lou? Lou?

403
00:42:39.398 --> 00:42:41.491
What's going on?

404
00:44:04.216 --> 00:44:05.581
What the hell?

405
00:44:08.754 --> 00:44:10.619
Oh, shit!

406
00:44:12.858 --> 00:44:15.019
Come here!

407
00:44:29.675 --> 00:44:33.543
They caught him. They caught him.

408
00:44:41.687 --> 00:44:44.087
Why are we keeping him in here?

409
00:44:44.890 --> 00:44:48.053
-Where would you prefer, Larry?
-I don't know.

410
00:44:48.327 --> 00:44:50.955
I told you to stay in 3, didn't l?
Did I tell you that?

411
00:44:51.129 --> 00:44:55.896
They got in a fight! I tried to
get them to go back inside!

412
00:44:56.068 --> 00:44:58.832
Should we try the radio again?

413
00:44:59.137 --> 00:45:02.937
Larry, just stay here and watch him.

414
00:45:03.108 --> 00:45:06.635
-Go back and look after Ginny.
-Where are you going?

415
00:45:06.979 --> 00:45:09.641
Just do it, please.

416
00:45:10.549 --> 00:45:11.777
Ed?

417
00:45:15.554 --> 00:45:18.182
I don't know if I'm comfortable
with guard duty, per se.

418
00:45:18.857 --> 00:45:22.020
He's unconscious, Larry.
He's tied to a post.

419
00:45:45.050 --> 00:45:47.484
Timothy.

420
00:45:50.389 --> 00:45:52.448
Timothy.

421
00:45:58.897 --> 00:46:04.199
Alice? Oh, my God. Alice?

422
00:46:05.537 --> 00:46:07.903
I don't remember anything.

423
00:46:08.640 --> 00:46:11.200
We had an accident.

424
00:46:12.144 --> 00:46:14.669
George? Can you keep
an eye on Ginny for a minute?

425
00:46:14.980 --> 00:46:21.180
She's awake now. I have
to get some aspirin to help her.

426
00:46:22.521 --> 00:46:25.684
Darling, I gotta go get
something out of my room.

427
00:46:42.441 --> 00:46:45.239
-Shit!
-What's wrong, buddy?

428
00:46:45.911 --> 00:46:47.708
What do you got in the fridge?

429
00:46:48.613 --> 00:46:51.309
-You shut up.
-What's in there?

430
00:46:53.752 --> 00:46:56.380
What's in there?

431
00:46:56.555 --> 00:46:58.523
-What do you got in there?
-Shut up.

432
00:46:58.924 --> 00:47:00.755
What is it, huh?

433
00:47:00.926 --> 00:47:02.689
-Shut up.
-You can tell me.

434
00:47:02.994 --> 00:47:07.090
I'm good at keeping secrets.
I got a whopper myself.

435
00:47:26.485 --> 00:47:28.077
What are you doing?

436
00:47:28.520 --> 00:47:29.714
Motherfucker!

437
00:47:29.888 --> 00:47:33.722
-What are you doing out here?
-Getting shit that's mine.

438
00:47:33.892 --> 00:47:37.521
What are you doing?
What, I don't get to ask a question?

439
00:47:37.696 --> 00:47:41.097
I'm taking photos. There's been two
murders. Before all the evidence--

440
00:47:41.266 --> 00:47:45.396
That's not an answer. You're a limo
driver. What are you doing?

441
00:47:45.570 --> 00:47:49.506
Looking to win some "beyond the call
of duty," Iimo-driver merit badge?

442
00:47:49.674 --> 00:47:52.973
You're not on the job anymore.
You don't need to be a hero.

443
00:47:53.145 --> 00:47:55.511
There's a real, live,
active-duty cop outside--

444
00:47:55.680 --> 00:47:58.478
The one who's managed to lose
a convicted killer?

445
00:48:01.052 --> 00:48:02.815
You're a complicated cat, Edward.

446
00:48:03.955 --> 00:48:06.355
No. Not really.

447
00:48:06.758 --> 00:48:09.022
I think so.

448
00:48:11.263 --> 00:48:13.697
What month were you born?

449
00:48:14.232 --> 00:48:17.133
-May.
-Taurus.

450
00:48:18.203 --> 00:48:20.000
Same as me.

451
00:48:23.308 --> 00:48:26.971
-Where were you a cop?
-Los Angeles.

452
00:48:27.512 --> 00:48:30.675
Were you fired or did you quit?

453
00:48:31.082 --> 00:48:33.346
I took medical leave.

454
00:48:33.885 --> 00:48:36.649
It was making me sick.

455
00:48:37.856 --> 00:48:41.087
I burned out, I guess.
Wasn't up for it.

456
00:48:45.230 --> 00:48:47.425
One day I got a call...

457
00:48:49.801 --> 00:48:52.133
...for a jumper.

458
00:48:52.304 --> 00:48:54.272
A young Mexican girl.

459
00:48:56.808 --> 00:49:00.266
Pregnant, infected with AIDS,
totally strung-out.

460
00:49:00.879 --> 00:49:04.440
She was truly one of the doomed.

461
00:49:07.486 --> 00:49:11.388
I asked her to come in off
the ledge and into my arms.

462
00:49:11.957 --> 00:49:14.983
She asked me why
she should bother living.

463
00:49:21.399 --> 00:49:23.697
What did you say?

464
00:49:25.804 --> 00:49:28.568
I was trained
to tell her lots of things.

465
00:49:28.740 --> 00:49:32.039
Her dreams, all the people
who'd miss her.

466
00:49:32.911 --> 00:49:35.812
But for a second, I hesitated.

467
00:49:36.948 --> 00:49:39.007
And she saw it.

468
00:49:42.220 --> 00:49:47.715
Within that second, I couldn't think of
one optimistic thing to say to her.

469
00:49:51.496 --> 00:49:54.693
So she spread her arms
and jumped.

470
00:49:59.905 --> 00:50:02.203
I started getting headaches...

471
00:50:04.509 --> 00:50:07.672
...and eventually started blacking out.

472
00:50:08.914 --> 00:50:13.283
So I filed for medical.

473
00:50:29.134 --> 00:50:31.261
What?

474
00:50:33.572 --> 00:50:35.335
What is it?

475
00:50:39.678 --> 00:50:41.475
Rhodes!

476
00:50:41.646 --> 00:50:46.743
-It's worse. Nothing but static!
-Where's that key from the actress?

477
00:50:48.219 --> 00:50:50.517
This was on the kid.

478
00:50:52.190 --> 00:50:54.954
-What is it, some kind of countdown?
-Larry!

479
00:50:57.495 --> 00:51:01.090
What the fuck is he doing?
Larry, come over here!

480
00:51:01.733 --> 00:51:05.533
Come over here, man.
What are you doing? Come over here.

481
00:51:06.938 --> 00:51:10.032
-What are you doing?
-I just went to get something.

482
00:51:10.976 --> 00:51:14.673
We told you to watch the guy.
What are you doing in your office?

483
00:51:15.480 --> 00:51:16.947
I just went to get something.

484
00:51:17.115 --> 00:51:20.846
How many sets of keys are there
to this place? Look at me. How many?

485
00:51:21.019 --> 00:51:23.453
-Two and a master set.
-Oh, my fucking God!

486
00:51:24.289 --> 00:51:30.694
Larry, you mother--! You son of a--!
Get the fuck in here! Get in here!

487
00:51:32.731 --> 00:51:35.325
Why did you kill him?
Why did you kill my con?

488
00:51:35.500 --> 00:51:40.403
Holy shit! Who did that?
Jesus Christ, I didn't do that!

489
00:51:40.572 --> 00:51:42.164
Bullshit! You're lying!

490
00:51:42.340 --> 00:51:46.242
-It's your bat sticking out of his throat!
-I know, but I didn't do it!

491
00:51:46.411 --> 00:51:48.140
Check the doors!

492
00:51:48.313 --> 00:51:49.940
