733
01:11:21.385 --> 01:11:24.980
He's had a very troubled life.
He was arrested four years ago...

734
01:11:25.155 --> 01:11:28.522
...and convicted of the murder
of six people in a violent rampage.

735
01:11:28.992 --> 01:11:31.222
-He did this.
-Detective, please.

736
01:11:31.395 --> 01:11:33.022
Edward, listen to me.

737
01:11:33.430 --> 01:11:39.335
When faced with an intense trauma,
a child's mind may fracture...

738
01:11:39.503 --> 01:11:43.064
...creating disassociated identities.

739
01:11:43.874 --> 01:11:47.310
That's exactly what happened
to Malcolm Rivers.

740
01:11:47.477 --> 01:11:49.877
He developed a condition
that is commonly known...

741
01:11:50.047 --> 01:11:52.948
...as Multiple Personality Syndrome.

742
01:11:58.188 --> 01:12:00.122
Why are you telling me this?

743
01:12:01.391 --> 01:12:03.655
Because you, Edward...

744
01:12:03.827 --> 01:12:06.955
...are one of his personalities.

745
01:12:11.435 --> 01:12:13.062
What?

746
01:12:27.651 --> 01:12:30.916
Jesus Christ! What the fuck
did you do to my face?

747
01:12:31.088 --> 01:12:32.783
-Keep calm.
-Where is my face?

748
01:12:32.956 --> 01:12:35.447
-That is your face.
-Why am I tied up?

749
01:12:35.626 --> 01:12:37.218
-Keep calm.
-Where is--?

750
01:12:37.394 --> 01:12:38.918
-Please.
-Jesus Christ!

751
01:12:39.096 --> 01:12:41.257
-Where is my face?
-Stay calm.

752
01:12:41.431 --> 01:12:45.128
No! I'm not gonna stay calm!
Why am I tied up like this?

753
01:12:45.302 --> 01:12:48.760
Who are all these people?
What happened at the motel?

754
01:12:48.939 --> 01:12:51.965
-Where is everybody?
-They don't exist, Edward.

755
01:12:52.142 --> 01:12:54.736
You were all created
by Malcolm as a child.

756
01:12:54.912 --> 01:12:57.312
-You're a liar!
-Consider what you know.

757
01:12:57.481 --> 01:12:59.847
-Everyone named after a state.
-No.

758
01:13:00.017 --> 01:13:03.475
Everyone sharing the same birthday.
Your blackouts.

759
01:13:03.654 --> 01:13:05.121
No! I was a cop!

760
01:13:05.289 --> 01:13:09.020
I was a cop in the Rampart Division
of L.A.P.D. for six years.

761
01:13:09.192 --> 01:13:10.216
Edward, please.

762
01:13:10.394 --> 01:13:12.794
I live in Hollywood,
in a studio apartment.

763
01:13:12.963 --> 01:13:15.329
-You don't live there.
-I do live there!

764
01:13:15.599 --> 01:13:17.362
You don't live anywhere.

765
01:13:17.701 --> 01:13:21.762
I know this is difficult to accept,
but the face you saw in that mirror...

766
01:13:21.939 --> 01:13:27.241
...is the face I've always seen when
I talk to Edward or Paris or Larry...

767
01:13:27.411 --> 01:13:29.345
...or anyone else you've met tonight.

768
01:13:29.513 --> 01:13:33.449
Malcolm is in the midst
of a medical treatment.

769
01:13:33.617 --> 01:13:39.180
One which forces all his identities to
confront one another for the first time.

770
01:13:39.356 --> 01:13:41.881
I knew there would be violence...

771
01:13:42.059 --> 01:13:47.292
...and with it, the number
of the identities would be reduced.

772
01:13:49.633 --> 01:13:51.533
Reduced?

773
01:13:51.702 --> 01:13:54.500
One of the personalities
you've met tonight, Edward...

774
01:13:54.671 --> 01:13:57.572
...committed those murders
four years ago.

775
01:13:57.941 --> 01:14:01.707
He took control of Malcolm's body,
as you have now...

776
01:14:01.878 --> 01:14:07.077
...and released an unspeakable rage.
And in 1 9 hours...

777
01:14:07.250 --> 01:14:10.811
...Malcolm Rivers will be put to death
because of those actions...

778
01:14:10.988 --> 01:14:14.856
...unless I can convince that man...

779
01:14:15.025 --> 01:14:17.425
...that the killer is gone.

780
01:14:20.697 --> 01:14:23.131
I need you to stay with me.
Edward?

781
01:14:23.300 --> 01:14:26.599
I need your help.
I need your help to finish this.

782
01:14:27.170 --> 01:14:28.933
Edward, listen to me.

783
01:14:30.173 --> 01:14:31.868
Edward, stay with me.

784
01:14:32.042 --> 01:14:34.909
Listen to me.
I need you to understand.

785
01:14:35.078 --> 01:14:38.241
The killer cannot survive.

786
01:14:38.415 --> 01:14:39.677
Edward!

787
01:15:06.877 --> 01:15:08.401
Got it?

788
01:15:09.479 --> 01:15:13.040
I can't see a thing.
Is there a flashlight?

789
01:15:13.216 --> 01:15:14.843
Hang on. Hang on.

790
01:15:15.352 --> 01:15:19.083
-You got a flashlight?
-Yeah, yeah, it's dead. Goddamn it.

791
01:16:03.867 --> 01:16:05.334
Shut up!

792
01:16:11.441 --> 01:16:14.239
Hey. What am I
supposed to wear, man?

793
01:16:14.411 --> 01:16:16.208
You're in it.

794
01:16:28.091 --> 01:16:29.080
Larry.

795
01:16:30.861 --> 01:16:33.261
Larry, come here.

796
01:16:39.703 --> 01:16:41.261
Ed!

797
01:16:49.679 --> 01:16:51.613
Ed!

798
01:17:05.862 --> 01:17:07.830
Larry!

799
01:17:12.836 --> 01:17:15.737
-Larry!
-Paris.

800
01:17:16.740 --> 01:17:17.866
Paris.

801
01:17:20.744 --> 01:17:22.541
Larry?

802
01:17:25.682 --> 01:17:28.583
Larry? Larry?

803
01:17:31.688 --> 01:17:34.418
Where are the keys to the truck?

804
01:17:34.591 --> 01:17:36.718
Where are the keys to the truck?

805
01:17:40.864 --> 01:17:44.027
-That was good, Larry.
-We gotta get out of here.

806
01:17:44.201 --> 01:17:47.227
-Ed has the keys to the truck.
-I got a spare right here.

807
01:17:47.404 --> 01:17:50.373
-Where is he?
-I don't know. Here.

808
01:17:51.374 --> 01:17:54.309
-What are you doing?
-We need a gun.

809
01:17:55.412 --> 01:17:56.504
Holy shit!

810
01:18:00.016 --> 01:18:01.950
Give me the keys to the truck.

811
01:19:01.978 --> 01:19:03.673
Ed!

812
01:19:03.847 --> 01:19:05.747
We gotta get out of here!

813
01:19:05.915 --> 01:19:08.213
-Paris--
-He's coming. He's--

814
01:19:08.385 --> 01:19:10.717
-Stay here.
-What's wrong with you?

815
01:19:10.887 --> 01:19:13.617
Paris, listen to me.

816
01:19:13.790 --> 01:19:16.190
Stay here.

817
01:19:17.394 --> 01:19:19.589
It's gonna be okay.

818
01:19:44.788 --> 01:19:47.780
Throw me the keys to the truck, Ed.

819
01:19:49.893 --> 01:19:53.488
Throw me the keys to the truck.
Stay there. Stay there!

820
01:20:26.129 --> 01:20:29.860
Ed! Ed! Ed!

821
01:20:35.138 --> 01:20:37.572
Ed, let me see.

822
01:20:37.741 --> 01:20:39.470
We gotta get you to a hospital.

823
01:20:39.642 --> 01:20:41.735
We're gonna get you
to a hospital, okay?

824
01:20:41.911 --> 01:20:44.812
Stay with me because
I'm gonna get you to the truck.

825
01:20:44.981 --> 01:20:48.610
Put your arm around my neck.
You gotta hold on, okay?

826
01:20:48.785 --> 01:20:54.451
You with me, Ed? Stay with me.
Okay. One, two, three.

827
01:20:55.525 --> 01:20:59.859
You gotta help me get you up.
Ed, you gotta push a little bit.

828
01:21:01.798 --> 01:21:05.165
Ed, why won't you let me help you?

829
01:21:06.669 --> 01:21:08.296
Where did you go before?

830
01:21:08.471 --> 01:21:12.271
What did you see?
Tell me what you saw.

831
01:21:15.245 --> 01:21:17.839
I saw you.

832
01:21:21.751 --> 01:21:25.152
I saw you in an orange grove.

833
01:21:55.018 --> 01:21:57.885
Why won't you let me help you?

834
01:21:59.022 --> 01:22:01.388
Where did you go?

835
01:22:01.558 --> 01:22:03.617
What did you see?

836
01:22:06.963 --> 01:22:09.261
I saw you...

837
01:22:11.000 --> 01:22:14.333
...in an orange grove.

838
01:22:50.507 --> 01:22:55.809
The question, Your Honor, is whether
to convict the body or the mind.

839
01:22:56.412 --> 01:23:00.007
His body committed these murders,
that is true.

840
01:23:00.183 --> 01:23:02.447
The person who remains
inside did not.

841
01:23:02.619 --> 01:23:04.177
Judge Taylor, that may not be true--

842
01:23:04.354 --> 01:23:06.845
We witnessed the destruction
of 1 0 identities tonight.

843
01:23:07.023 --> 01:23:08.786
Nine were innocent
and one was guilty.

844
01:23:08.958 --> 01:23:09.947
They're not real!

845
01:23:10.126 --> 01:23:12.424
The violence that existed in him
has been executed.

846
01:23:12.595 --> 01:23:17.259
Your Honor, Malcolm belongs
in a state hospital.

847
01:23:21.638 --> 01:23:26.439
In the matter of Rivers v. Nevada, it is
the recommendation of this court...

848
01:23:26.609 --> 01:23:29.271
...that Mr. Rivers' execution
be stayed.

849
01:23:29.445 --> 01:23:33.279
I am transferring Mr. Rivers
to state psychiatric services...

850
01:23:33.683 --> 01:23:36.618
...under the care of Dr. Mallick.

851
01:23:52.635 --> 01:23:57.231
Cracked heels and washed-out horns
Blow into my face with scorn

852
01:23:57.407 --> 01:24:01.707
But it's not that way
I wasn't born to lose you

853
01:24:01.878 --> 01:24:04.176
I want you

854
01:24:04.347 --> 01:24:06.542
I want you

855
01:24:06.716 --> 01:24:10.948
I want you so bad

856
01:25:23.559 --> 01:25:25.322
Timmy.

857
01:25:53.790 --> 01:25:55.553
No, please don't.

858
01:25:56.993 --> 01:26:00.724
No, Timmy, please.

859
01:26:00.897 --> 01:26:02.865
What is it, Malcolm?

860
01:26:11.407 --> 01:26:12.601
Malcolm?

861
01:26:12.775 --> 01:26:14.970
Whores don't get a second chance.

862
01:26:32.628 --> 01:26:35.426
When I was going up the stairs

863
01:26:35.598 --> 01:26:39.432
I met a man who wasn't there

864
01:26:39.602 --> 01:26:42.298
H.e wasn't there again today

865
01:26:42.472 --> 01:26:46.431
I wish
I wish he'd go away



0
00:00:0,500 --> 00:00:2,00
